    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong> puts you in the shoes of a student trying to find his place in a world full of strange occurrences and <strong>unexpected</strong> twists. What begins as a simple search for a job to earn money for a gift for Stacey quickly escalates into a deeper journey, challenging your perception of reality. As you take on a job at a local <strong>kiosk</strong>, you begin to experience increasingly bizarre and unsettling events that make you question <strong>what is real</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got ability to <strong>receive messages from NPCs</strong> via chat<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialog system with ability to <strong>make choices</strong>. Every choice got his own <strong>affect</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>in-game desktop</strong> with ability to find job! <i>(Mini game will be available right after demo)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickup</strong>, <strong>Drop</strong> and <strong>Interact</strong> with shop and <i>any other items</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric environment</strong> and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS film</strong> aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleasant interaction</strong> with products and items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration game (walking simulator) where realism plays a key role. Walk through realistic locations, discover strange truths, and face unexpected challenges.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Loops</strong> puts you in the shoes of a student trying to find his place in a world full of strange occurrences and <strong>unexpected</strong> twists. What begins as a simple search for a job to earn money for a gift for Stacey quickly escalates into a deeper journey, challenging your perception of reality. As you take on a job at a local <strong>kiosk</strong>, you begin to experience increasingly bizarre and unsettling events that make you question <strong>what is real</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got ability to <strong>receive messages from NPCs</strong> via chat<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/0bbe821acc65a31dd90aa0c811004ea2.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialog system with ability to <strong>make choices</strong>. Every choice got his own <strong>affect</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/2a467a286669734c50d60993ef2ab826.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>in-game desktop</strong> with ability to find job! <i>(Mini game will be available right after demo)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/17cd1d11951af992bc7ee13d3c3a280e.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickup</strong>, <strong>Drop</strong> and <strong>Interact</strong> with shop and <i>any other items</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.poster.avif?t=1752346933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.webm?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629360/extras/d8ce16176609cfc252190ffbdc7155bd.mp4?t=1752346933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric environment</strong> and photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS film</strong> aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleasant interaction</strong> with products and items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration game (walking simulator) where realism plays a key role. Walk through realistic locations, discover strange truths, and face unexpected challenges.</p>",
    "short_description": "Caught in a strange series of events, you find yourself stuck in a job you never expected. What started as a simple way to earn money for a gift soon spirals into something much darker. As you navigate your new reality, the boundaries between what\u2019s real and what\u2019s not become harder to distinguish.",
